<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank sets repo at unchanged 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank sets repo at unchanged 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Thursday it was calling for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements, or repos, at a fixed and unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0900 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 12.08 billion schillings, filling 12 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
</text>
